gh is different.<br></li><li><strong>Explore </strong>a vast procedurally generated city full of enemies, loot and hidden passages.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVAL MECHANICS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Scavenge </strong>for resources.<br></li><li>Deal with sanity, hunger and thirst while trying to survive. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEADLY NIGHT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Find </strong>a monolith before nightfall as the night is dark and full of terrors.<br></li><li>Monoliths will keep you safe, surviving the night is hopeless without them.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SETTLEMENTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Settlements built around mysterious monoliths are the last safe places in the capital.<br></li><li><strong>Interact </strong>with NPCs like traders, blacksmiths and weapon masters.<br></li><li><strong>Learn </strong>new abilities, buy new equipment or upgrade your existing gear.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829560/extras/aee0084af2bec1aef18060ded8f79dd7.webp?t=1673381032\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2>I am <strong>NECROW</strong> a <strong>solo developer</strong>, the only creator of NECROBLADE.<br><br>If you have any questions or suggestions, please join the <strong>Official Discord server</strong> or follow me @devNecrow on <strong>Twitter</strong>.<br><br>Also if you want to support the project, please <strong>WISHLIST </strong>and <strong>FOLLOW </strong>the game on Steam.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829560/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1673381032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829560/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1673381032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829560/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1673381032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "NECROBLADE is a grimdark fantasy adventure with survival and RPG elements. On your way to the heart of the capital, you must explore, scavenge, battle hordes of enemies and upgrade abilities to survive. Which will kill you? The terrible curse or the deadly quest to break it?",
